# d3mon dark: flat, low-contrast near-black surfaces, one loud accent.
# Titlebar (Header, WM) uses the window colour so windows read as one
# surface, like Dracula KDE.
#
# Selection: solid accent in the active window; unfocused windows get
# a calm green-grey ([Colors:Selection][Inactive]) instead of KDE's
# 40% accent tint, which turned olive on near-black.
#
# Palette: bg #070707, window #141416, view #0f0f11, raise #1c1c1f,
# ink #eceee9, ink2 #c6c9c3, dim #8a8d88, accent #91e611 (ink #0b1400),
# ok #6fd13a, warn #f0b43c, bad #ff5f56.

